<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">14082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Two tankers operated by Abu Dhabi's national oil company were struck transiting the Strait of Hormuz, and nobody has claimed responsibility.</s> <s>No one has to close the strait to price it — war-risk insurance reprices on incident count alone, and Brent now trades near ninety-three dollars a barrel, up thirty-two percent in thirty days.</s> <s>The bill lands not on shipowners but on the import accounts of Pakistan, Bangladesh, India and Egypt... and deniability is precisely the weapon.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In southern Iran, a fisherman named Sajjad watched his boat burn — about three hundred vessels destroyed across four ports of Hormozgan since American strikes began in July.</s> <s>Those same strikes cut bridges, power lines and phone towers across a south that's disproportionately Arab and Baloch and poor, the communities with the least political voice in Tehran.</s> <s>Five months into a war Washington says it has won, the visible cost is a coastline that can't feed itself.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Displaced women in eastern Congo face rising sexual violence, and the reporting's central finding overturns the usual frame — most assaults in the camps are committed by neighbours, not soldiers.</s> <s>Camp design produces the exposure: women walk kilometres for water and firewood, shelters don't lock, and there's no lighting after dark.</s> <s>Lighting, latrine placement and women-led registration measurably reduce the harm, and they're the first line cut when humanitarian budgets fall.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Voters in Clacton-on-Sea went to the polls in a by-election that both major British parties declined to seriously contest.</s> <s>Under first-past-the-post, a party polling near thirty percent nationally can win outright when its rivals split — which is how a farcical ballot becomes a live test of whether the electoral system is about to hand a plurality party a majority government.</s> <s>What follows from that would set the terms on asylum, Channel crossings, and arms exports to Israel.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Venezuela's opposition leader María Corina Machado has retained a Republican lobbying firm in Washington, disclosed in a foreign-agent filing to the Justice Department.</s> <s>She's lobbying Washington rather than Caracas, which is an accurate map of where the decision now sits — and the same firm represents the oil companies that moved into Venezuelan crude this year.</s> <s>Since the new arrangement began, the Financial Times calculates about thirteen billion dollars has been taken out of the country against three hundred million returned in profits.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The American military has stood up its first multinational one-way attack drone task force, based in the Gulf.</s> <s>A one-way attack drone is a cruise missile at a hundredth of the price, and the interceptor built to stop it costs millions — so whoever fields the cheap side wins the arithmetic.</s> <s>Washington hasn't named the participating countries, and that's the point: a coalition distributes the capability and dissolves the answer to whose drone killed whom.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>British taxpayers subsidised therapy for serving Israeli soldiers, because a UK-registered charity claimed Gift Aid on the donations funding it.</s> <s>Gift Aid adds twenty-five pence of public money to every pound given, automatically, with no minister's decision — and charity law asks whether purposes are charitable, not which foreign army benefits.</s> <s>The Charity Commission acts on complaint rather than by sweep, and hasn't said whether it'll look.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Pakistani general has taken command of <sub alias="MINURSO">MINURSO</sub>, the mission whose own name promises a referendum in Western Sahara.</s> <s>That vote has never been held — Morocco and the Polisario Front still dispute who counts as a Sahrawi voter, freezing an agreement signed in nineteen ninety-one.</s> <s>He inherits a stalemate that has now outlasted the generation it was meant to enfranchise.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan raised high-speed diesel to three hundred and eighty-three rupees a litre from Friday.</s> <s>Diesel is the one that reaches everyone — it moves freight, runs tube wells and powers generators, so the increase passes into wheat, vegetables and electricity for households that own no vehicle at all.</s> <s>With an <sub alias="I M F">IMF</sub> programme constraining subsidy and a petroleum levy the state depends on for revenue, Islamabad has almost no room to cushion the blow.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bengaluru's draft rules would charge residents up to twenty-five thousand rupees a year to park on the public road outside their own homes.</s> <s>Pricing the kerb doesn't create a cost — it reveals one, because free storage of a two-tonne object on scarce public land has always been a subsidy that simply went unnamed.</s> <s>The city can't widen its roads, so every parked car occupies the lane a bus or a footpath would otherwise use.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A fire tore through the powder-pressing department of a munitions plant at Colleferro, south of Rome, with workers sheltering safely.</s> <s>Compacting propellant is the single most dangerous step in making an artillery shell, and the site's been scaling output for Europe's hundred-and-fifty-five-millimetre rearmament drive.</s> <s>Prosecutors are examining what failed at a plant running faster than it was built to run.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukrainian drones burned nearly two billion dollars of stock in the warehouses of Wildberries, Russia's largest online retailer.</s> <s>Kyiv says the depots double as distribution for military supply, but the loss falls on the small sellers who financed the goods and receive no compensation.</s> <s>An adviser to Zelenskyy says the strikes are meant to reach ordinary Russians — which is an unusually candid statement of intent.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Tether, the largest dollar stablecoin, has passed its first full audit, with <sub alias="K P M G">KPMG</sub> counting its gold bars by hand.</s> <s>A full audit examines a year of books, unlike the single-date attestations the company relied on for a decade.</s> <s>The auditors found reserves exceeded liabilities by six point eight billion dollars, though Tether hasn't said whether it'll publish the full findings.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China's Tianwen-three mission aims to bring Martian rock back to Earth, and the hard part isn't the containment — it's proving it to everyone else.</s> <s>International guidelines require sealed handling so nothing that touched Mars meets our atmosphere unfiltered, but those guidelines are advice, not law, and no treaty gives outside scientists a right of inspection.</s> <s>The probability of a living Martian organism is very low; the cost if that estimate is wrong is unbounded, and only Beijing will be able to verify Beijing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An outbreak of Bundibugyo virus in the Democratic Republic of Congo has become the second-largest Ebola epidemic ever recorded, and no licensed vaccine protects against this strain.</s> <s>Animal studies suggest the existing vaccine Ervebo may cross-protect, so the World Health Organization has recommended a full trial during the outbreak itself.</s> <s>Kinshasa's health ministry now has to run a clinical trial and an emergency response with the same exhausted staff — a trial that will, God willing, arrive in time to matter.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Astronomers say a long-standing mystery of unexplained radio pulses has a mundane answer: a dead white dwarf orbiting a small red star.</s> <s>The pairing works like Jupiter and its moon Io, where an orbiting body drags through a magnetic field and completes an electrical circuit.</s> <s>No exotic new physics required... just company, and nobody yet knows how many such pairs are out there.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A litigant in Connecticut hid invisible text inside a court filing, instructing any AI model that read it to side with him.</s> <s>Language models treat instructions and text through the same channel, so concealed words in a document double as commands — the same vulnerability now sitting under every institution that reads its paperwork by machine.</s> <s>The judge noted the court itself uses no AI, meaning the filer was betting on a reader who wasn't there yet.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Punjab's provincial government has linked six thousand systems into a single network, with electronic procurement alone processing one point two nine million tenders.</s> <s>Removing the counter clerk removes the moment where a bribe is asked — that's the theory of digital governance, tested here at the scale of a hundred and twenty million people.</s> <s>Chief Minister Maryam Nawaz has ordered continuous rollout, though whether discretion disappears or simply migrates upward is the question worth watching.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Korea is committing eight hundred and eighty billion dollars to becoming a centre of the global AI buildout.</s> <s>Seoul's run this playbook before — shipbuilding, then steel, then memory chips, each time converting a manufacturing lead into a permanent position.</s> <s>How much of that sum is state money and how much is corporate hasn't been disclosed, which is precisely the number that decides whether it's a plan or a press release.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>